{"content_hash": "2370acba260eec6d", "version_id": 713, "article_id": 72, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Kylie Jenner wears $50m bra at Victoria's Secret show", "title_zh": "凯莉·詹娜穿5000万美元胸罩亮相维密秀，引发争议", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "bbc_culture", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmx2wqwxvyxlo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/flagged/photo-1557286249-08f5bc2ef21d?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8a3lsaWUlMjBqZW5uZXJ8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MjQ1NjMzNXww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Joel Muniz on Unsplash", "author": "Joel Muniz", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@jmuniz?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/man-pointing-forward-mXF1hOJ37BI?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(338, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(16, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "8b222ce941c5"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-20", "word_count": 185, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "Reality TV star Kylie Jenner surprised the crowd at the Victoria's Secret Fashion Show on Sunday. She wore the famous Fantasy Bra, which is worth $50m. Not everyone was happy about it.", "lead_zh": "真人秀明星凯莉·詹娜周日惊喜亮相维多利亚的秘密时装秀。她穿着价值5000万美元的著名“梦幻胸罩”。但并不是所有人都对此感到高兴。", "preview": "The bra was made of 18-carat gold and 4,410 diamonds, according to the designer. Wearing the Fantasy Bra is usually a big honour for a model", "preview_zh": "据设计师介绍，这件胸罩由18K金和4410颗钻石制成。穿上“梦幻胸罩”通常对模特来说是巨大的荣誉。一些粉丝对29岁的詹娜被选中感到高兴，但许多人批评品牌没有选择资深超模。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 699, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 66.5, "size_bytes": 399888, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 214, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 67.6, "size_bytes": 406512, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 214, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 71.775, "size_bytes": 431568, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 214, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 62.275, "size_bytes": 374544, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 214, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/72/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 66.475, "size_bytes": 399744, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 214, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/72/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@fec3522/content/data/versions/713.json", "paragraphs": ["The bra was made of 18-carat gold and 4,410 diamonds, according to the designer. Wearing the Fantasy Bra is usually a big honour for a model. Some fans were delighted that Jenner, 29, was chosen, although many others criticised the brand for not picking a veteran supermodel.", "Marketing expert Joel Marlinarson says the moment was well planned. He believes brands now care more about who brings the most attention than who fits the traditional idea of a model. However, he adds that older viewers may see it as a betrayal of the fashion they grew up with.", "On social media, some people cheered Jenner, but many called it \"pure disrespect to real models\". One person said the show had gone \"from iconic glamour to an influencer circus\". Victoria's Secret's creative chief said Jenner was picked because she is a \"cultural powerhouse\".", "British model Summer Nesbeth thinks the brand chose Jenner to connect with young fans. But she also feels the focus on such an expensive bra shows \"how detached we are\". She points out that many people cannot afford basic things like food or electricity."], "paragraphs_zh": ["据设计师介绍，这件胸罩由18K金和4410颗钻石制成。穿上“梦幻胸罩”通常对模特来说是巨大的荣誉。一些粉丝对29岁的詹娜被选中感到高兴，但许多人批评品牌没有选择资深超模。", "营销专家乔尔·马利纳森表示，这一时刻是精心策划的。他认为，品牌现在更看重谁能带来最多关注，而不是谁符合传统意义上的模特形象。不过，他补充说，年长的观众可能会觉得这是对他们所熟悉的时尚的背叛。", "在社交媒体上，一些人支持詹娜，但许多人称这是“对真正模特的纯粹不尊重”。有人说这场秀“从标志性的魅力变成了网红的马戏团”。维密首席创意官表示，选择詹娜是因为她是一位“文化强者”。", "英国模特萨默·内斯贝斯认为，品牌选择詹娜是为了与年轻粉丝建立联系。但她也觉得，对如此昂贵胸罩的关注显示出“我们有多么脱节”。她指出，许多人连食物或电费这样的基本开销都负担不起。"], "body": "The bra was made of 18-carat gold and 4,410 diamonds, according to the designer. Wearing the Fantasy Bra is usually a big honour for a model. Some fans were delighted that Jenner, 29, was chosen, although many others criticised the brand for not picking a veteran supermodel.\n\nMarketing expert Joel Marlinarson says the moment was well planned. He believes brands now care more about who brings the most attention than who fits the traditional idea of a model. However, he adds that older viewers may see it as a betrayal of the fashion they grew up with.\n\nOn social media, some people cheered Jenner, but many called it \"pure disrespect to real models\". One person said the show had gone \"from iconic glamour to an influencer circus\". Victoria's Secret's creative chief said Jenner was picked because she is a \"cultural powerhouse\".\n\nBritish model Summer Nesbeth thinks the brand chose Jenner to connect with young fans. But she also feels the focus on such an expensive bra shows \"how detached we are\". She points out that many people cannot afford basic things like food or electricity.", "body_zh": "据设计师介绍，这件胸罩由18K金和4410颗钻石制成。穿上“梦幻胸罩”通常对模特来说是巨大的荣誉。一些粉丝对29岁的詹娜被选中感到高兴，但许多人批评品牌没有选择资深超模。\n\n营销专家乔尔·马利纳森表示，这一时刻是精心策划的。他认为，品牌现在更看重谁能带来最多关注，而不是谁符合传统意义上的模特形象。不过，他补充说，年长的观众可能会觉得这是对他们所熟悉的时尚的背叛。\n\n在社交媒体上，一些人支持詹娜，但许多人称这是“对真正模特的纯粹不尊重”。有人说这场秀“从标志性的魅力变成了网红的马戏团”。维密首席创意官表示，选择詹娜是因为她是一位“文化强者”。\n\n英国模特萨默·内斯贝斯认为，品牌选择詹娜是为了与年轻粉丝建立联系。但她也觉得，对如此昂贵胸罩的关注显示出“我们有多么脱节”。她指出，许多人连食物或电费这样的基本开销都负担不起。", "text": "The bra was made of 18-carat gold and 4,410 diamonds, according to the designer. Wearing the Fantasy Bra is usually a big honour for a model. Some fans were delighted that Jenner, 29, was chosen, although many others criticised the brand for not picking a veteran supermodel. Marketing expert Joel Marlinarson says the moment was well planned. He believes brands now care more about who brings the most attention than who fits the traditional idea of a model. However, he adds that older viewers may see it as a betrayal of the fashion they grew up with. On social media, some people cheered Jenner, but many called it \"pure disrespect to real models\". One person said the show had gone \"from iconic glamour to an influencer circus\". Victoria's Secret's creative chief said Jenner was picked because she is a \"cultural powerhouse\". British model Summer Nesbeth thinks the brand chose Jenner to connect with young fans. But she also feels the focus on such an expensive bra shows \"how detached we are\". She points out that many people cannot afford basic things like food or electricity.", "vocab": [{"word": "debut", "pos": "noun", "zh": "首次亮相", "note": "常与 make 搭配：make one's debut", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "spark", "pos": "verb", "zh": "引发", "note": "spark reaction/debate 引发反应/争论", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "mixed reaction", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "褒贬不一的反应", "note": "表示有人支持也有人反对", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "criticise", "pos": "verb", "zh": "批评", "note": "英式拼写，美式为 criticize", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "veteran", "pos": "adj", "zh": "资深的", "note": "veteran model 资深模特", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "engineer", "pos": "verb", "zh": "精心策划", "note": "此处指刻意安排、设计", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "betrayal", "pos": "noun", "zh": "背叛", "note": "a betrayal of sth 对某事的背叛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "glamour", "pos": "noun", "zh": "魅力；光彩", "note": "常指时尚娱乐圈的华丽感", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "detached", "pos": "adj", "zh": "脱节的；疏离的", "note": "be detached from 与……脱节", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "afford", "pos": "verb", "zh": "负担得起", "note": "can't afford to do sth 负担不起做某事", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-20T00:32:12.999882", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.325, "sm": 250, "em": 325, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "bra", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.625, "sm": 325, "em": 625, "cs": 4, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "was", "s": 0.625, "e": 0.775, "sm": 625, "em": 775, "cs": 8, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "made", "s": 0.775, "e": 0.963, "sm": 775, "em": 962, "cs": 12, "ce": 16, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "of", "s": 0.963, "e": 1.087, "sm": 962, "em": 1087, "cs": 17, "ce": 19, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "18", "s": 1.087, "e": 1.284, "sm": 1087, "em": 1284, "cs": 20, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "-", "s": 1.284, "e": 1.383, "sm": 1284, "em": 1382, "cs": 22, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "carat", "s": 1.383, "e": 1.875, "sm": 1382, "em": 1875, "cs": 23, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "gold", "s": 1.875, "e": 2.525, "sm": 1875, "em": 2524, "cs": 29, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "and", "s": 2.525, "e": 2.688, "sm": 2525, "em": 2687, "cs": 34, "ce": 37, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "4,410", "s": 2.688, "e": 3.875, "sm": 2687, "em": 3875, "cs": 38, "ce": 43, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "diamonds", "s": 3.875, "e": 4.6, "sm": 3875, "em": 4599, "cs": 44, "ce": 52, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": ",", "s": 4.6, "e": 4.7, "sm": 4600, "em": 4699, "cs": 52, "ce": 53, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "according", "s": 4.7, "e": 5.125, "sm": 4700, "em": 